	/// Definition: Total pay in dollars to employees, adding standard, leave, overtime and other pay, in each week, fortnight or month.
	/// For analysis: Report helper for conditional formatting; same result as WorkerAmountPaid. Not for analysis.
	measure WorkerTotalPayrollAmount = [WorkerLeaveAmount] + [WorkerOvertimeAmount] + [WorkerOtherAmount] + [WorkerStandardAmount]
		displayFolder: WeeklyMonthly
		lineageTag: 97ed2208-0db0-47b4-a994-7d5470ed44ed

