	/// Definition: Total hours paid to employees, adding standard, leave, overtime and other hours, in each week, fortnight or month.
	/// For analysis: Report helper for conditional formatting; same result as WorkerHoursPaid. Not for analysis.
	measure WorkerTotalPayrollHours = [WorkerLeaveHours] + [WorkerOvertimeHours] + [WorkerOtherHours] + [WorkerStandardHours]
		displayFolder: WeeklyMonthly
		lineageTag: c16603e0-0c7d-4c37-bbdc-35d050a647c6

